# Goodreads exports: never commit these (only the one fake sample the tests use)
*.csv
!tests/fixtures/sample-goodreads.csv
# Other spreadsheet/export formats, and anything named like a Goodreads export, anywhere in the repo
*.numbers
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.ods
*.tsv
/goodreads*
**/goodreads_library_export*
# PDFs: the résumé is added ON PURPOSE. To publish it, put it in this folder as resume.pdf
# and add the line "!resume.pdf" below this comment.
*.pdf
# The ONE deliberate exception: the published, phone-number-free résumé (assets/resume.pdf). Nothing else.
!assets/resume.pdf
# downloaded cover pictures must never be committed
covers/
# your real site: npm run build writes the complete deployable site here (never the repo root)
site/
# the preview build (npm run build:sample) writes here
preview/
.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log
